# Contracts (Stage 4)

`VerifiableCredentialRegistry.sol` will live here. Functions:
`issueCredential()`, `verifyCredential()`, `revokeCredential()`, `getCredential()`.

Store only: credential ID, document hash, issuer address, recipient address,
timestamp, revoked flag. Only the original issuer can revoke; duplicate IDs are
rejected; events are emitted for issue and revoke.
